@Backdate a Document @driver.miedb.dbExec("UPDATE documents SET origin_date=DATE_SUB(origin_date, INTERVAL 10 YEAR) WHERE doc_id=541")
Open the sidemenu
Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
#Click the "System" charttab
#Click the "System Report" charttab subtab
Navigate "?f=admin&s=system_report&tabmodule=admin"
Type "Mark Documents As Read" in the "search_value" input
Click the "Search" button
Click the "Mark Documents As Read" listview link
Verify exists "INJECT" text
Click the "Perform" link
Click the "Perform All" button
Verify exists "( 1 ) Performed action on 8/8 records from system report (Mark Documents As Read)" text
Click the "OK" button
Click the "Refresh" link
Verify !exists "INJECT" text
@Restore the origin_date on the Backdated Document@driver.miedb.dbExec("UPDATE documents SET origin_date=DATE_ADD(origin_date, INTERVAL 10 YEAR) WHERE doc_id=541")

